    "/xact": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Synchronize up to 100 Beancount transaction strings; not a general mutation API.\n\nOnly Cashier-created completed `*` transactions with stable `cashier_id` metadata\nand already-known server accounts are accepted. Incomplete `!` transactions,\ninclude/plugin/option/open/close/balance/pad and all other directives are rejected.\nSame cashier_id + same transaction is idempotent: synchronized without appending.\nSame cashier_id + different transaction is rejected as a conflict, never overwritten.\nMixed batches have partial success: valid items commit; invalid items receive\nconcrete reasons in `rejected` at HTTP 200. A rejection may have null `cashier_id`\nwhen an ID cannot be recovered. `synchronized` includes both new and existing IDs.\n\nThe only target is configured BEANCOUNT_MANUAL_TRANSACTIONS_FILE, normally\n/workspace/manual_transactions.bean, the sole rw file in a read-only workspace.\nNo client target path or writable ledger directory is accepted. Under a file lock,\nthe server rereads/deduplicates, builds a private candidate, validates it through\nthe configured full-root BEANCOUNT_FILE pipeline, then performs a crash-conscious\nsingle-file write. This is not an atomic rename or a promise of crash atomicity.\nExact `@@` total prices survive storage and snapshot without rounded `@` conversion.\nEquivalent retries compare normalized transaction content, not literal whitespace;\ndiffering total amount, currency or @/@@ notation is a conflict. Full-pipeline failure\ncan reject the entire pending new subset; HTTP 200 alone never means every item synced.\nLimits per item: 64 KiB UTF-8, 256 postings, 64 metadata fields, metadata keys at most\n64 characters and string values at most 1024 UTF-8 bytes. cashier_id is case-sensitive\nASCII, 1..128 characters, starts with a letter/digit, followed by letters/digits or\n`.`, `_`, `:`, `-`. Violations are per-item rejections, not request-schema errors.",
        "operationId": "write_xact_xact_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/XactRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/XactResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Synchronized IDs and per-item rejections, including mixed partial success."
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Invalid Host or Content-Length; malformed request."
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
